rows=[
('033','Cycle quartet fixture has six stale digest links','The current problem/candidate/verifier/receipt bytes do not match any of the six embedded cross/self digest links under the README and actual transcoder encoding. Independent integer checks confirm d1*z=0 and d2_extended*[0,1]=z, so this is current custody drift, not refutation of that submitted finite witness. Receipt is explicitly UNVERIFIED; no assertion is made about historical archive loss.',[ev(284,4,25),ev(285,5,15),ev(286,5,17),ev(287,57,62),ev(168,16,24)],['PFPINFRA-P044'],'Preserve the historical objects and produce a separately versioned regenerated quartet with source/encoding pins and checked link readback; do not silently repair historical bytes.'),
('034','Generated mode schema rejects its mode13 contract','The current closed ModeFile schema and type source omit quotient_descent_guards added to mode13. Draft202012Validator rejects the checked-in contract as an unexpected additional property.',[ev(353,24,27),ev(365,34,99),ev(366,26,66)],['PFPINFRA-P045'],'Update the authoritative type declaration, regenerate derived models and add actual full-catalog validation before claiming matching generated contracts.'),
('035','Universal dependency-preserving6NF normalization is not available','Mode13 simultaneously promises arbitrary FD preservation, lossless joins and a unique irreducible6NF result. The finite ABC schema with AB->C,C->B is not BCNF, yet all proper projections together imply only C->B and cannot recover AB->C. Hence the universal normalization promise already fails at the dependency-preserving BCNF step; lexical tie-breaking and bounded saturation cannot supply the missing theorem.',[ev(353,5,16),ev(354,9,9),ev(354,31,43)],['PFPINFRA-P046'],'Specify the admitted dependency/rule class, distinguish3NF synthesis from BCNF/6NF tradeoffs, preserve a residual obligation or refuse when required properties cannot coexist.'),
('036','Older cognitive and mode declarations exceed their finite predicates','Old YAML says fixed numeric bands prevent sycophancy, seed/identity diversity prevents false consensus, and antibody lookup has zero false alarms; none follows from supplied scores/IDs/hashes. The current intergate README explicitly treats the ten YAML files as design references and limits current native checks to declared input/readback/trust predicates, so these are documentation-level overstatements rather than fresh evidence of the native verifier failing.',[ev(323,32,37),ev(324,29,33),ev(329,28,31),ev(341,9,16),ev(333,3,18),ev(333,31,40)],[],'Retain historical design bytes but expose status/edition on consuming indexes; present finite operational predicates separately from untested cognitive effectiveness, statistical independence and detector adequacy.'),
('037','Gate register has unresolved transition targets','IG07 and IG08 transition to PFP-07-MASTER, while the22-item primary register names PFP-07-MANUSCRIPT-TRUTH. Both YAML design files preserve the same old target. This prevents interpreting the register as a closed graph without an explicit alias/version rule; the current native source profile is separately named and is not alleged to fail by this identity-only check.',[ev(322,30,33),ev(322,125,134),ev(329,3,4),ev(330,3,4)],['PFPINFRA-P047'],'Declare an explicit historical alias mapping or emit a current versioned register with checked referential closure.'),
]
